1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,087
Corridor Watch.

2
00:00:01,507 --> 00:00:03,105
Investigate the corridor.

3
00:00:03,525 --> 00:00:05,053
Keep the decision human.

4
00:00:05,803 --> 00:00:08,805
Alerts are still judged one transaction at a time.

5
00:00:09,225 --> 00:00:12,907
Laundering hides in the hops and shared devices around a payment.

6
00:00:13,327 --> 00:00:16,567
What investigators learn is lost when the case closes.

7
00:00:16,987 --> 00:00:22,670
And in regulated work, an LLM that invents a bank owner is not a tool — it is a risk.

8
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:34,805
Corridor Watch is the triage console across several cases and typologies — mule pass-through, split-transaction laundering, shared-device rings, multi-hop chains.

9
00:00:35,225 --> 00:00:41,169
Three pillars: see the corridor, explain with grounded AI, remember what is confirmed.

10
00:00:41,919 --> 00:00:52,070
On CW-LOTUS-04, the corridor map shows coverage — not guilt: observed, external, inferred, and unknown.

11
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:59,716
On CW-MID-01, shared device and beneficiary links surface the mule fingerprint.

12
00:01:00,136 --> 00:01:07,988
On CW-LOTUS-02, split-transaction and multi-hop structure light up in the money flow.

13
00:01:08,408 --> 00:01:17,039
On CW-MID-02, the score is deterministic from a twelve-step evidence pack — the model does not write the number.

14
00:01:17,789 --> 00:01:20,955
The deterministic engine builds the evidence pack first.

15
00:01:21,375 --> 00:01:24,650
Gemini sees tokens only — never the raw ledger.

16
00:01:25,070 --> 00:01:33,726
It returns a structured brief: why this looks this way, still unknown, what to check next — with evidence chips that cite the pack.

17
00:01:34,146 --> 00:01:39,343
Provenance is visible: prefetch, grounded, fallback, or gate fail.

18
00:01:39,763 --> 00:01:46,706
Safety test on CW-MID-03: the output gate rejects an invented bank owner.

19
00:01:47,126 --> 00:01:52,026
Gemini cannot hold, escalate, or freeze — and cannot change the score.

20
00:01:52,446 --> 00:01:55,803
Model in use: gemini-2.5-flash.

21
00:01:56,553 --> 00:02:03,326
On CW-LOTUS-04, an analyst is refused consequential actions.

22
00:02:03,746 --> 00:02:07,235
The FIU lead is allowed — and a human must authorize.

23
00:02:07,655 --> 00:02:10,273
Every decision writes a readable audit entry.

24
00:02:11,023 --> 00:02:13,399
Confirm the decision as FIU lead.

25
00:02:13,819 --> 00:02:16,208
The Pattern DNA library updates.

26
00:02:16,628 --> 00:02:23,449
A new alert, CW-MID-03, matches the fingerprint with a non-zero score.

27
00:02:23,869 --> 00:02:26,895
Institutional memory — not a one-off wire.

28
00:02:27,645 --> 00:02:29,674
The transaction is not the crime.

29
00:02:30,094 --> 00:02:31,078
The network is.

30
00:02:31,498 --> 00:02:32,585
Corridor Watch.

31
00:02:33,005 --> 00:02:34,468
Synthetic demo data.

